{"type":"Film","id":"FR2017_008","slug":"fr2017-008-le-divan-de-staline","title":{"native":"Le Divan de Staline","english":"Stalin's Couch"},"release":{"type":"Theatrical release","date":"2017-01-11","year":2017},"filmType":"Fiction film","directors":[{"id":"Fanny Ardant","slug":"fanny-ardant","name":"Fanny Ardant","birthYear":1949,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Female identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[{"film":{"slug":"fr2022-021-les-jeunes-amants","title":{"native":"Les Jeunes Amants"}},"year":2023,"award":"César du cinéma","category":"Best Actress Female","result":"Nominated"},{"film":{"slug":"fr2020-091-adn","title":{"native":"ADN"}},"year":2021,"award":"César du cinéma","category":"Best Supporting Actress","result":"Nominated"},{"film":{"slug":"fr2019-181-la-belle-epoque","title":{"native":"La Belle Époque"}},"year":2020,"award":"César du cinéma","category":"Best Supporting Actress","result":"Awarded"}]}],"genre":["Drama","Historical film (Heritage Film)"],"media":{"posterUrl":"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/38/153/170278/format_page/le-divan-de-staline.jpg","trailerUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=I3DGXqd-_Vw"},"synopsis":{"native":"Staline vient se reposer trois jours dans un château au milieu de la forêt. Il est accompagné de sa maîtresse de longue date, Lidia. Dans le bureau où il dort, il y a un divan qui ressemble à celui de Freud à Londres. Il propose à Lidia de jouer au jeu de la psychanalyse, la nuit. Durant le jour, un jeune peintre, Danilov attend d’être reçu par Staline pour lui présenter le monument d’éternité qu’il a conçu à sa gloire. Un rapport trouble, dangereux et pervers se lie entre les trois. L’enjeu est de survivre à la peur et à la trahison.","english":"Stalin has come to rest for three days in a castle in the middle of the forest. He is accompanied by his long-time mistress, Lidia. In the office where he sleeps there is a couch that resembles Freuid's couch in London. He suggests to Lidia that they play a psychoanalyst game at night. During the day, Danilov, a young painter, waits to be introduced to Stalin in order to offer him the monument of eternity that he has conceived to honor him. A disturbing, dangerous, and twisted relationship develops between the trio. What is at stake is to survive fear and betrayal."},"production":[{"country":"France","share":"Majority coproducer"},{"country":"Portugal","share":"Minority coproducer"},{"country":"Russian Federation (the)","share":"Minority coproducer"}],"characters":[{"id":"FR2017_008_01","film":"FR2017_008","person":{"id":"Gérard Depardieu","slug":"gerard-depardieu","name":"Gérard Depardieu","birthYear":1948,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Russian Federation (the)","awards":[{"film":{"slug":"fr2015-084-valley-of-love","title":{"native":"Valley of Love"}},"year":2016,"award":"César du cinéma","category":"Best Actor Male","result":"Nominated"}]},"age":"3: Third Age (60-75)","gender":"Male identifying","sexuality":"Heterosexual","origin":"White Eastern European","class":"Upper class","profession":"Self-employed","ability":"Able-bodied","assistedMobility":"No"}],"roles":[{"person":{"id":"Fanny Ardant","slug":"fanny-ardant","name":"Fanny Ardant","birthYear":1949,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Female identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[{"film":{"slug":"fr2022-021-les-jeunes-amants","title":{"native":"Les Jeunes Amants"}},"year":2023,"award":"César du cinéma","category":"Best Actress Female","result":"Nominated"},{"film":{"slug":"fr2020-091-adn","title":{"native":"ADN"}},"year":2021,"award":"César du cinéma","category":"Best Supporting Actress","result":"Nominated"},{"film":{"slug":"fr2019-181-la-belle-epoque","title":{"native":"La Belle Époque"}},"year":2020,"award":"César du cinéma","category":"Best Supporting Actress","result":"Awarded"}]},"role":"Director of the film"},{"person":{"id":"François Chattot","slug":"francois-chattot","name":"François Chattot","birthYear":1953,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying",